# Where the shared series store is — and nothing else, because this file is handed to every
# agent container. Copy to `infra/.env`.
#
# What is NOT here any more: the admin token, the bucket name, and the Grafana password.
#
#   - The admin token opens every bucket. It lives in `infra/secrets/admin.env` (gitignored,
#     template beside this file), read by the infra containers and by the two provisioning
#     tools — never by an agent. It used to be here, which meant `env_file: [infra/.env]` put
#     it in the environment of every agent, and per-agent tokens would have been theatre.
#   - The bucket is per agent now, minted by `orexis-influx` into that agent's own credential
#     file. See knowledge/decisions/series-and-bus-isolation.md.
#
# Both names below are safe for everyone to hold: they say where the store is, not what may
# be done to it.

INFLUX_URL=http://localhost:8086
INFLUX_ORG=orexis
